      "id": 130247019,
      "date": "2026-08-22",
      "name": "Stretch",
      "type": "WORKOUT",
      "planned_tss": null,
      "duration_hours": 0.13,
      "duration_formatted": "8m",
      "workout_summary": null,
      "description": "Knee-friendly mobility routine (~7 min total) \u2014 swapped out kneeling positions due to left anterior knee pain (likely PFPS) since 2026-08-01 long run; avoiding deep knee flexion under load until it's settled.\nRest days or after easy runs, not after hard runs.\n\nFoam rolling (~4 min):\n\nQuads (front of thigh) \u2014 45s per leg\nIT band (outer thigh) \u2014 45s per side\nGlutes \u2014 30s per side\n\nStatic stretching (~3 min):\n\nStanding quad stretch (pull heel toward glutes) \u2014 30s per leg\nStanding hip flexor stretch (big lunge step, no knee on ground, tuck pelvis under) \u2014 30s per leg\nSeated figure-4 (ankle on opposite knee, lean forward) \u2014 30s per side\n\nDropped a separate standing IT-band stretch \u2014 the foam rolling and figure-4 cover that ground without adding time."
